  "title": "You&#39;ve Gotta Be Kidding Onions",
  "description": "Sweet onions are marinated overnight in vinegar, then mixed with mayonnaise and seasoned with celery salt. This recipe sounded too bizarre to be true, but once you try it, you&#39;re hooked! Serve with saltine crackers. It&#39;s a big hit at parties.",
